     <narrative xml:lang="EN">% of active registered community members who have learned ECA and other relevant approaches and tools through the FACS Community (% of women).</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Active, registered community members are defined as members who are registered to the Green Commodities Digital Community and participated in at least 2 events in the last 6 months. Application of lessons learned is defined as learnings/ key takeaways acquired through the Green Commodities Community events (workshops, webinars, trainings, discovery sessions) that members have applied in their work by changing programs, practices, and/or policies including how and where (country/context) they have used them.</narrative>
    </description>
