    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">All external programmes and projects that benefit from services/advisory/contribution of the GCP project are counted. When advisory benefits the whole programme or project (or most of its components), the full budget of the project is reported; when services target a specific outcome or component of a large programme or project, only the budget of this outcome/component is reported. Initiatives and activities directly funded through GCP are not counted. The interpretation includes both cost-recovery and co-financing funding streams. Details are being tracked via the GCP programme dashboard.</narrative>
